malloc()	
Memory allocate karta hai	
Memory uninitialized hoti hai (garbage values)
1 argument leta hai
malloc(sizeof(int))

syntax:->>
ptr = (datatype *)malloc(size_in_bytes);

calloc()
2 arguments leta hai
Memory 0 se initialize hoti hai
Memory allocate karta hai
calloc(number,sizeof(int))
p[0] → 0
p[1] → 0
p[2] → 0
p[3] → 0
p[4] → 0

syntax->>
ptr = (datatype *)calloc(number, size);



malloc() → memory allocate
calloc() → memory allocate + 0 initialize
realloc() → existing memory ka size change

syntax-->>
p = (int *)malloc(5 * sizeof(int));
p = (int *)realloc(p, 10 * sizeof(int));

free() → memory release
free(p);
